      "factual_description": "Jazz at Lincoln Center presents Saxophone Colossus: Celebrating Sonny Rollins at Dizzy's Club on Thursday, September 10, 2026, with sets at 7:00 PM and 9:00 PM. JALC describes the program as a multigenerational celebration of Rollins' improvisational legacy, with four announced saxophonists — Melissa Aldana, Jerry Weldon, Chris Lewis and Jacob Chung — under the musical direction of pianist Luther Allison, joined by Jared Beckstead-Craan on bass and Anwar Marshall on drums. The official event page states that the ensemble will perform music inspired by Rollins' contributions to jazz; no additional repertoire is inferred.",
