      "factual_description": "Jazz at Lincoln Center presents Gaia Wilmer Large Ensemble featuring Mônica Salmaso: Reflections on Gilberto Gil at Dizzy's Club from Friday, September 11 through Sunday, September 13, 2026. Friday and Saturday have 7:00 PM and 9:00 PM sets; Sunday has 5:00 PM and 7:30 PM sets. JALC frames the engagement as an album release celebration honoring Gilberto Gil, with Wilmer reimagining Gil's songs through a large jazz ensemble, Brazilian rhythms, horn arrangements and Salmaso's vocals. The current JALC performance-lineup section names Wilmer as arranger/composer/conductor and Salmaso as vocalist but does not yet publish the individual supporting large-ensemble personnel, so no recording personnel are copied into the live lineup. Apple Music lists Parabólico: Reflections on Gilberto Gil (feat. Mônica Salmaso) by Gaia Wilmer and Gaia Wilmer Large Ensemble as a seven-track, 58-minute Sunnyside Records release dated August 14, 2026.",
